                        "step": "Mix components except sulfur, adjust pH to 6.8 and autoclave under a N2-CO2 (4:1, v/v) atmosphere. Distribute medium into culture vessels (e.g., 18 ml in 100 ml serum bottles) containing appropriate amount of sulfur under a N2-CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture, and seal with butyl rubber stoppers. Aseptically and anaerobically add the following solutions (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized) to the above described basal medium (900 ml): "
